\ A three-deep chain of tail calls ending in a raising generic native. The interpreter elides
\ the tail frames, so only the non-tail top-level call renders a row. The eager and AOT runs
\ must elide the same frames; the AOT twin is aot_error_frames_generic_native.1z, which keeps
\ the same line layout.

inner: ( a b -- c ) [ + ] ;
outer: ( a b -- c ) [ inner ] ;

1 "x" outer .
